    {
      "text": "设 $A'=\\mathrm{diag}(1,2,3)$，考虑 $Q'(x,y,z)=x^2+2y^2+3z^2$。求 $\\displaystyle\\iiint_{\\mathbb{R}^3}e^{-Q'}\\,dV$ 及 $\\displaystyle\\iiint_{\\mathbb{R}^3}(x^2+y^2+z^2)e^{-Q'}\\,dV$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "对角二次型的高斯积分",
        "分离变量计算带权重积分"
      ],
      "question_type": "计算题",
      "method": [
        "分离变量法",
        "标准高斯积分公式"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "直接分离变量计算第一个积分",
        "对第二个积分逐项分离计算并求和"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "diagonal_quadratic_form_gaussian_integral",
        "template": "$Q'=x^2+2y^2+3z^2$，求 $\\iiint e^{-Q'}dV$ 及 $\\iiint(x^2+y^2+z^2)e^{-Q'}dV$",
        "variable_count": 3
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 12,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "第一个积分",
          "steps": [
            "分离变量：$\\iiint e^{-(x^2+2y^2+3z^2)}dV=\\int e^{-x^2}dx\\cdot\\int e^{-2y^2}dy\\cdot\\int e^{-3z^2}dz=\\sqrt\\pi\\cdot\\sqrt{\\pi/2}\\cdot\\sqrt{\\pi/3}=\\frac{\\pi^{3/2}}{\\sqrt6}$。",
            "验算：一般公式 $\\pi^{3/2}/\\sqrt{\\det A'}$，$\\det A'=1\\cdot2\\cdot3=6$，得 $\\pi^{3/2}/\\sqrt6$，一致。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "第二个积分",
          "steps": [
            "逐项计算：$I_x=\\int x^2e^{-x^2}dx\\cdot\\int e^{-2y^2}dy\\cdot\\int e^{-3z^2}dz=\\frac{\\sqrt\\pi}{2}\\cdot\\sqrt{\\pi/2}\\cdot\\sqrt{\\pi/3}=\\frac{\\pi^{3/2}}{2\\sqrt6}$。",
            "$I_y=\\int e^{-x^2}dx\\cdot\\int y^2e^{-2y^2}dy\\cdot\\int e^{-3z^2}dz$，其中 $\\int y^2e^{-2y^2}dy=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\pi/2}}{4}$，得 $I_y=\\sqrt\\pi\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{\\pi/2}}{4}\\cdot\\sqrt{\\pi/3}=\\frac{\\pi^{3/2}}{4\\sqrt6}$。",
            "$I_z=\\int e^{-x^2}dx\\cdot\\int e^{-2y^2}dy\\cdot\\int z^2e^{-3z^2}dz$，其中 $\\int z^2e^{-3z^2}dz=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\pi/3}}{6}$，得 $I_z=\\sqrt\\pi\\cdot\\sqrt{\\pi/2}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{\\pi/3}}{6}=\\frac{\\pi^{3/2}}{6\\sqrt6}$。",
            "总和 $I_x+I_y+I_z=\\frac{\\pi^{3/2}}{\\sqrt6}\\left(\\frac12+\\frac14+\\frac16\\right)=\\frac{\\pi^{3/2}}{\\sqrt6}\\cdot\\frac{11}{12}=\\frac{11\\pi^{3/2}}{12\\sqrt6}$。验算：用 $\\mathrm{tr}(A'^{-1})=1+\\frac12+\\frac13=\\frac{11}{6}$，公式 $\\frac{\\pi^{3/2}}{2\\sqrt{\\det A'}}\\mathrm{tr}(A'^{-1})=\\frac{\\pi^{3/2}}{2\\sqrt6}\\cdot\\frac{11}{6}=\\frac{11\\pi^{3/2}}{12\\sqrt6}$，一致。"
          ]
        }
      ],
